          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The city gates will mourn and cry, and the city itself will be like a woman sitting on the ground, stripped naked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
